# 📊 Dataset

The production project uses historical ENTSO-E market data.

The public repository contains representative demo datasets used for dashboard deployment and reproducibility.

Covered markets:

- 🇩🇪 Germany
- 🇬🇷 Greece

Frequency:


Hourly



