# 🚀 Deployment Notes

The Streamlit Cloud application uses lightweight demo datasets specifically prepared for public deployment.

The production version operates on significantly larger historical datasets and locally generated model outputs that are not included in this repository.

The current deployment demonstrates the complete analytical workflow while remaining fully reproducible.


